---
const photo = "https://www.figma.com/api/mcp/asset/1a7f6ba7-d79b-4e0a-8d16-2bf3914dabf9.png";
---

<section class="py-20 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 items-stretch">

    <!-- Left: photo -->
    <div class="h-64 sm:h-80 md:h-auto min-h-0 order-1">
      <img
        src={photo}
        alt="Book Formatting"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
    </div>

    <!-- Right: text -->
    <div class="bg-[rgba(217,217,217,0.1)] flex flex-col justify-center px-6 sm:px-8 md:px-10 py-10 sm:py-12 order-2">
      <h2 class="font-bold text-xl sm:text-2xl uppercase leading-snug text-black mb-3 sm:mb-4">
        HEARST Book Studio A Leading Book Formatting Company
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[#555] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
        At HearEst Book Studio, we understand that how your book looks on the
        page matters just as much as what it says. Our expert formatting team
        transforms your raw manuscript into a visually compelling, reader-friendly
        layout that meets the highest industry standards for both print and digital
        publishing.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[#555] text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Whether you're self-publishing or working with a traditional house, our
        formatting specialists ensure your book is structurally sound, beautifully
        presented, and ready for every major distribution platform. From trim size
        selection to chapter headers, we handle every detail so you can focus on
        your story.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-10">
  <p class="text-[#555] text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-center">
    Professional book formatting is the invisible foundation of every great reading experience. Our team
    at HearEst Book Studio applies decades of publishing expertise to ensure your manuscript flows
    elegantly from the first page to the last — with consistent margins, balanced white space, clean
    typography, and precisely placed chapter breaks. We format for print, hardcover, ebook, and
    print-on-demand platforms so your work looks its absolute best wherever your readers find it.
  </p>
</div>
